=== The Bureaucratodon Grievance === #^event:creature-arbitration

-> "The Unauthorized Skyline Beam" #^transition:wilds-to-cape

? Resolve the labor dispute #^decision:resolve-grievance
* [Approve the full settlement] #^outcome:full-settlement
    ~ $"keyCount"<variable:keyCount> = 3
    ~ $"solidarity"<variable:solidarity> = 4
    ~ $undefined<undefined> = undefined
* [Negotiate phased reimbursement] #^outcome:mediation
    ~ $"keyCount"<variable:keyCount> = 3
    ~ $"solidarity"<variable:solidarity> = 3
    ~ $undefined<undefined> = undefined
